DEPENDENCIES

onekeyirc links against the operating system's C library and OpenSSL-compatible
TLS libraries. No terminal display library is linked. Dependency source is
not bundled in this source distribution. Each dependency keeps its own
copyright notices, license terms, and security maintenance policy.

Common upstream references:

    OpenSSL: https://www.openssl.org/
    LibreSSL: https://www.libressl.org/

Consult the actual installed dependency version's license. Dependency
licenses are not replaced by the application's license. Distributors that
bundle or statically link dependency code must retain the notices and
comply with the licenses applicable to those exact dependency versions.

Optional encrypted credentials invoke GnuPG as a separate program; its
source is not bundled. The test suite uses Python 3 and Bash for local
integration tests. These are not required by the installed client.
